{
  "$overlay": "flex-split-main-rail",
  "$notes": [
    "Structural-neutral only: geometry channels (display/flexDirection/gap/dimensions/stylingBox). No surfaces, hairlines, shadow or colour — those live on the cards placed inside the slots.",
    "0.46: Main fills via width '100%' + minWidth:0 beside the fixed 332px rail (exact px: wrapper becomes fit-content, rail min-width stops it shrinking). The 0.45 form was 'calc(100% - 348px)' (rail 332 + gap 16); on 0.46 a calc width is applied to BOTH the sha-component wrapper and the container inside it (stylingUtils.ts), so it can narrow the column twice. Re-introduce calc only if the probe shows main ~= row - 348 and doubleShrinkSuspect false. NOT yet measured on a running 0.46 app.",
    "Rail is fixed 332px (min=max=332) and is itself a flex column (gap 16) so stacked rail cards space evenly.",
    "Tablet + mobile collapse BOTH children to width:'100%' (min 0, max 100%) so the rail stacks under the main."
  ],
  "targets": {
    "bodySplit": {
      "desktop": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flexDirection": "row",
        "justifyContent": "space-between",
        "alignItems": "flex-start",
        "flexWrap": "nowrap",
        "gap": "16",
        "stylingBox": "{\"marginBottom\":\"0\"}",
        "dimensions": {
          "width": "100%",
          "height": "auto",
          "minHeight": "fit-content",
          "maxHeight": "auto",
          "minWidth": "100%",
          "maxWidth": "100%"
        }
      },
      "tablet": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "alignItems": "stretch",
        "justifyContent": "flex-start",
        "flexWrap": "wrap",
        "gap": "16",
        "stylingBox": "{\"marginBottom\":\"0\"}",
        "dimensions": {
          "width": "100%",
          "height": "auto",
          "minHeight": "fit-content",
          "maxHeight": "auto",
          "minWidth": "0px",
          "maxWidth": "100%"
        }
      },
      "mobile": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "alignItems": "stretch",
